{"id": "plan-smr-good", "criterion": "plan_quality", "label": 4, "why": "Distinct questions covering cost, licensing, fuel and named projects.", "material": {"topic": "what limits deployment of small modular reactors in the US", "plan": ["Why was NuScale's Carbon Free Power Project cancelled?", "How long does NRC licensing take for a new SMR design, and what reforms apply?", "Is HALEU fuel supply a constraint, and when will US production scale?", "Which US SMR projects are under construction or delayed, and why?"], "rationale": ["The clearest real-world failure.", "Regulatory barrier.", "Fuel barrier.", "Current state of deployment."]}}
